 249:System/FreeRTOS/stream_buffer.c **** 		/* A stream buffer requires a StreamBuffer_t structure and a buffer.
 250:System/FreeRTOS/stream_buffer.c **** 		Both are allocated in a single call to pvPortMalloc().  The
 251:System/FreeRTOS/stream_buffer.c **** 		StreamBuffer_t structure is placed at the start of the allocated memory
 252:System/FreeRTOS/stream_buffer.c **** 		and the buffer follows immediately after.  The requested size is
